<title>FINLAND: Tamro 1996 profit, net sales by division.</title>
<headline>Tamro 1996 profit, net sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler Oy Tamro Ab on Friday gave the following breakdown by division of its 1996 results (million markka):</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT	    1996		 1995</p>
<p> Pharma Distribution	  170		  127</p>
<p> Medical and Laboratory	46		   52</p>
<p> Kolmi			     20		   16</p>
<p> Internal and other	     5		   14 loss</p>
<p> TOTAL			    242		   181</p>
<p>NET SALES</p>
<p> Pharma Distribution	12,342		9,958</p>
<p> Medical and Laboratory	536		  435</p>
<p> Kolmi			     263		  252</p>
<p> Internal and other	     79		   90</p>
<p> TOTAL			  13,220	     10,735</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
